# Pairs with TypeOK. Disabling a tree records a mode outside the model's
# domain instead of the not-enrolled marker.
MODULE: ReceiverEnrollmentLeavesDomain
TARGET: TypeOK
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a disabled tree's enrollment leaves the mode domain

--- FIND
    /\ enrolled' = [enrolled EXCEPT !["t1"] = mode]
--- REPLACE
    /\ enrolled' = [enrolled EXCEPT !["t1"] = IF mode = NotEnrolled THEN "Off" ELSE mode]
--- END